#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "UNIX-like {#unix-like}"
msgstr "UNIX-like {#unix-like}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section provides build instructions for UNIX-like systems.\n"
msgstr "Ang seksyong ito ay nagbibigay ng mga tagubilin sa pag-build para sa mga UNIX-like na sistema.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements}"
msgstr "Mga Kinakailangan {#requirements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compilation requires the following tools:\n"
"* A Rust compiler: see for example the [guide on installing Qiskit from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source)\n"
"* A C compiler: for example, GCC on Linux and Clang on MacOS. Qiskit's C API is compatible with a compiler conforming to the [C11](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C11_(C_standard_revision)) standard.\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): a tool to create the C header, which you can install with `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"   Running the tool from the command line should be enabled, which might require exporting your `PATH` variable to include `/path/to/.cargo/bin`.\n"
"* Python library installed (Python 3.9+): The Python library is required during dynamic linking. Notice that Python is not used at runtime and the interpreter is never initialized; only some symbols from `libpython` need to be defined. See [this issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/14240) for more details.\n"
"* (GNU) Make: this is optional but is recommended to use automated install processes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang compilation ay nangangailangan ng mga sumusunod na tools:\n"
"* Isang Rust compiler: tingnan halimbawa ang [gabay sa pag-install ng Qiskit mula sa source](/guides/install-qiskit-source)\n"
"* Isang C compiler: halimbawa, GCC sa Linux at Clang sa MacOS. Ang Qiskit C API ay compatible sa isang compiler na sumusunod sa pamantayang [C11](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C11_(C_standard_revision)).\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): isang tool para gumawa ng C header, na maaari mong i-install gamit ang `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"   Pinapahintulot ang pagpapatakbo ng tool mula sa command line, na maaaring mangailangan ng pag-export ng iyong `PATH` variable para isama ang `/path/to/.cargo/bin`.\n"
"* Naka-install na Python library (Python 3.9+): Kailangan ang Python library sa panahon ng dynamic linking. Pansinin na hindi ginagamit ang Python sa runtime at hindi kailanman ini-initialize ang interpreter; ilang simbolo lamang mula sa `libpython` ang kailangang tukuyin. Tingnan ang [isyung ito](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/issues/14240) para sa karagdagang detalye.\n"
"* (GNU) Make: opsyonal ito ngunit inirerekomenda para sa mga automated na proseso ng pag-install.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This code verifies that everything has been installed:\n"
msgstr "Bine-verify ng code na ito na naka-install na ang lahat:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build {#build}"
msgstr "Build {#build}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To build the C header and library, you can run the following Make command[^1] in Qiskit root,\n"
msgstr "Para i-build ang C header at library, maaari kang magpatakbo ng sumusunod na Make command[^1] sa Qiskit root,\n"

#. type: Link reference
#, no-wrap
msgid "[^1]: If you did not install Make, check the `Makefile` in Qiskit root for the required commands - or simply install Make; it's not too late."
msgstr "[^1]: Kung hindi mo na-install ang Make, tingnan ang `Makefile` sa Qiskit root para sa mga kinakailangang command — o i-install na lang ang Make; hindi pa huli para doon.)"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"which will provide the compiled shared library in `dist/c/lib` and the `qiskit.h` header with\n"
"all function declarations in `dist/c/include`. Note that the precise library name depends\n"
"on the platform; for example,`libqiskit.so` on UNIX and `libqiskit.dylib` on MacOS.\n"
"(Note that this step currently emits a lot of warnings, which is expected, and is no cause for alarm. Future versions will remove the warnings.)\n"
msgstr ""
"na magbibigay ng compiled shared library sa `dist/c/lib` at ang `qiskit.h` header na may\n"
"lahat ng function declaration sa `dist/c/include`. Tandaan na ang eksaktong pangalan ng library ay depende\n"
"sa platform; halimbawa, `libqiskit.so` sa UNIX at `libqiskit.dylib` sa MacOS.\n"
"(Tandaan na ang hakbang na ito ay kasalukuyang naglalabas ng maraming babala, na inaasahan, at walang dapat ipag-alala. Aalisin ng mga susunod na bersyon ang mga babala.)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can then compile a C program using the Qiskit C header and library:\n"
msgstr "Maaari ka na nitong mag-compile ng C program gamit ang Qiskit C header at library:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To ensure the Qiskit library is found during linking, set the runtime library path to\n"
"include `/path/to/dist/c/lib`. If the Python library is not available per default during dynamic linking,\n"
"this also needs to be added. These commands depend on the platform. On Linux:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para masiguro na mahahanap ang Qiskit library sa panahon ng linking, itakda ang runtime library path para\n"
"isama ang `/path/to/dist/c/lib`. Kung ang Python library ay hindi available bilang default sa panahon ng dynamic linking,\n"
"kailangan din itong idagdag. Ang mga command na ito ay depende sa platform. Sa Linux:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On MacOS:\n"
msgstr "Sa MacOS:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatively, you can set the runtime library path during compilation by adding\n"
msgstr "Bilang alternatibo, maaari mong itakda ang runtime library path sa panahon ng compilation sa pamamagitan ng pagdaragdag ng\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"to the compiler flags.\n"
"In addition, the Python library needs to be available during dynamic linking. In Linux environments\n"
"this is typically the default. \n"
msgstr ""
"sa mga compiler flag.\n"
"Bukod pa rito, kailangan na available ang Python library sa panahon ng dynamic linking. Sa mga Linux environment\n"
"ito ay karaniwang default.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now you can execute the binary:\n"
msgstr "Maaari ka na ngayong i-execute ang binary:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "which, if using the example snippet shown previously, should print\n"
msgstr "na, kung gagamitin ang halimbawang snippet na ipinakita kanina, ay dapat mag-print ng\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Windows {#windows}"
msgstr "Windows {#windows}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section provides build instructions for Windows systems.\n"
msgstr "Ang seksyong ito ay nagbibigay ng mga tagubilin sa pag-build para sa mga Windows system.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two independent ways to use the C API on Windows:\n"
msgstr "May dalawang magkahiwalay na paraan upang gamitin ang C API sa Windows:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Build Python extension modules** that use the Qiskit C API. Follow Steps 1-5. This path uses the C headers shipped with the `qiskit` Python package and does not require Rust or cbindgen.\n"
msgstr "**Bumuo ng Python extension modules** na gumagamit ng Qiskit C API. Sundan ang Steps 1-5. Ang landas na ito ay gumagamit ng mga C header na kasama sa `qiskit` Python package at hindi nangangailangan ng Rust o cbindgen.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Build the standalone C library** to link against from a pure C program, as is done in the [UNIX-like](#unix) section. Complete Step 1, then skip to [Build the standalone library](#build-the-standalone-library), which lists its additional requirements.\n"
msgstr "**Bumuo ng standalone C library** upang i-link mula sa isang purong C program, tulad ng ginagawa sa [UNIX-like](#unix) section. Kumpletuhin ang Step 1, pagkatapos ay lumaktaw sa [Build the standalone library](#build-the-standalone-library), na naglilista ng mga karagdagang requirement nito.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements-1}"
msgstr "Mga Kinakailangan {#requirements-1}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrator rights are required for some steps.\n"
msgstr "Kinakailangan ang mga karapatan bilang administrator para sa ilang hakbang.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "5-8 GB free disk space.\n"
msgstr "5-8 GB na libreng disk space.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A C compiler: Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC), installed in Step 1.\n"
msgstr "Isang C compiler: Microsoft Visual C++ (MSVC), na na-install sa Step 1.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A 64-bit Python installation (3.10 or later), installed in Step 1.\n"
msgstr "Isang 64-bit na Python installation (3.10 o mas bago), na na-install sa Step 1.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Bago ka magsimula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create your workspace.  This should be a short path on a local drive. Do not use OneDrive-synced folders (such as Documents or Desktop), network drives, or paths with spaces or non-ASCII characters. If your user name contains non-English characters, don't put it under your user folder.\n"
msgstr "Gumawa ng iyong workspace.  Dapat itong maikling path sa isang local drive. Huwag gumamit ng mga OneDrive-synced na folder (tulad ng Documents o Desktop), network drives, o mga path na may spaces o non-ASCII na mga character. Kung ang iyong username ay naglalaman ng non-English na mga character, huwag ilagay ito sa ilalim ng iyong user folder.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples of good workspace paths: `C:\\workspace`, `D:\\workspace`, `C:\\Users\\john\\workspace`\n"
msgstr "Mga halimbawa ng magandang workspace paths: `C:\\workspace`, `D:\\workspace`, `C:\\Users\\john\\workspace`\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1. Install the prerequisites {#step-1-install-the-prerequisites}"
msgstr "Step 1. I-install ang mga prerequisite {#step-1-install-the-prerequisites}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"MSVC Build Tools (C compiler) — install this first\">\n"
"This is a large download (2-5 GB, 10-30 min). Install it first so you know immediately whether your computer is compatible.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"MSVC Build Tools (C compiler) — i-install ito muna\">\n"
"Ito ay isang malaking download (2-5 GB, 10-30 min). I-install ito muna upang agad mong malaman kung compatible ang iyong computer.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Requires administrator rights.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Option A — `winget`** \n"
"Open a PowerShell terminal and run the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Option A — `winget`** \n"
"Magbukas ng PowerShell terminal at patakbuhin ang sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The terminal appears frozen while the installer runs.  This is normal and will take 10-30 minutes. Check your taskbar for a \"Visual Studio Installer\" window.\n"
msgstr "Magmumukhang frozen ang terminal habang tumatakbo ang installer.  Normal ito at aabutin ng 10-30 minuto. Tingnan ang iyong taskbar para sa isang \"Visual Studio Installer\" window.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If `winget` is not recognized, update [App Installer](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9nblggh4nns1) from the Microsoft Store, or use Option B.\n"
msgstr "Kung hindi kinikilala ang `winget`, i-update ang [App Installer](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9nblggh4nns1) mula sa Microsoft Store, o gamitin ang Option B.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Option B — manual download**\n"
"Open the [Visual Studio Build Tools for C++](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/visual-cpp-build-tools/) website and click Download Build Tools.  Run the executable to start the install.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Option B — manu-manong pag-download**\n"
"Buksan ang [Visual Studio Build Tools for C++](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/visual-cpp-build-tools/) website at i-click ang Download Build Tools.  Patakbuhin ang executable upang simulan ang pag-install.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the Installing Visual Studio window opens, on the Workloads tab, choose \"Desktop development with C++\". See the [Install C and C++ support in Visual Studio](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/vscpp-step-0-installation?view=msvc-170#step-4---choose-workloads) page for further details. \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"VS Code\">\n"
"Download VS Code from the [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/) site, or run `winget install Microsoft.VisualStudio.Code`. Run the downloaded executable file to install VS Code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag nagbukas ang Installing Visual Studio window, sa Workloads tab, piliin ang \"Desktop development with C++\". Tingnan ang [Install C and C++ support in Visual Studio](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/vscpp-step-0-installation?view=msvc-170#step-4---choose-workloads) page para sa karagdagang detalye. \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"VS Code\">\n"
"I-download ang VS Code mula sa [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/) site, o patakbuhin ang `winget install Microsoft.VisualStudio.Code`. Patakbuhin ang na-download na executable file upang i-install ang VS Code.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After it is installed, continue with these steps:\n"
"1. Open VS Code\n"
"2. Click File → Open Folder, then select your workspace (for example, `C:\\workspace`).\n"
"3. Click Terminal → New terminal to open a PowerShell terminal.\n"
"4. Click the Extensions icon on the left or press Ctrl+Shift+X. In the Extensions window, search for and install `ms-python.python`, `ms-toolsai.jupyter`, and `ms-vscode.cpptools`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos ma-install, ipagpatuloy ang mga hakbang na ito:\n"
"1. Buksan ang VS Code\n"
"2. I-click ang File → Open Folder, pagkatapos ay piliin ang iyong workspace (halimbawa, `C:\\workspace`).\n"
"3. I-click ang Terminal → New terminal upang magbukas ng PowerShell terminal.\n"
"4. I-click ang Extensions icon sa kaliwa o pindutin ang Ctrl+Shift+X. Sa Extensions window, hanapin at i-install ang `ms-python.python`, `ms-toolsai.jupyter`, at `ms-vscode.cpptools`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the rest of the commands in this guide in the VS Code terminal, unless otherwise instructed. The VS Code terminal defaults to PowerShell, preventing mix-ups with the Windows built-in command window. \n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang natitirang mga command sa gabay na ito sa VS Code terminal, maliban kung iba ang nakasaad. Ang VS Code terminal ay default na PowerShell, na nag-iiwas sa paghahalo sa built-in na command window ng Windows. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set the workspace variable.  For example, if your workspace is called `workspace`, run the following:\n"
msgstr "Itakda ang workspace variable.  Halimbawa, kung ang iyong workspace ay tinatawag na `workspace`, patakbuhin ang sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Python 3.12 (recommended version)\">\n"
"Python 3.12 is recommended because it has the best wheel availability for `qiskit-aer` and other dependencies. 3.10 and 3.11 also work, but 3.13 or later might lack pre-built wheels for some packages.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Python 3.12 (inirerekomendang bersyon)\">\n"
"Inirerekomenda ang Python 3.12 dahil mayroon itong pinakamahusay na wheel availability para sa `qiskit-aer` at iba pang dependency. Gumagana rin ang 3.10 at 3.11, ngunit maaaring kulang ng mga pre-built na wheel ang 3.13 o mas bago para sa ilang package.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open the VS Code terminal and run the following code to detect a suitable version of Python:\n"
msgstr "Buksan ang VS Code terminal at patakbuhin ang sumusunod na code upang matukoy ang angkop na bersyon ng Python:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the download didn't work, or you prefer manual download, comment out the code lines that install Python 3.12, then download Python 3.12 from the [Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/) website.  Run the executable to install Python.  Select \"Add Python to PATH\" during the install, then rerun the above snippet to make sure it's being found.\n"
msgstr "Kung hindi gumana ang pag-download, o mas gusto mo ang manu-manong pag-download, i-comment out ang mga linya ng code na nag-i-install ng Python 3.12, pagkatapos ay i-download ang Python 3.12 mula sa [Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/) website.  Patakbuhin ang executable upang i-install ang Python.  Piliin ang \"Add Python to PATH\" habang nag-i-install, pagkatapos ay muling patakbuhin ang snippet sa itaas upang matiyak na nahanap ito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- Do NOT use the Microsoft Store Python because it lacks C headers. If `python` opens the Microsoft Store, disable the alias by going to Windows Settings → Apps → Advanced app settings → App execution aliases.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga Tala\">\n"
"- HUWAG gamitin ang Microsoft Store Python dahil kulang ito ng C headers. Kung binubuksan ng `python` ang Microsoft Store, i-disable ang alias sa pamamagitan ng pagpunta sa Windows Settings → Apps → Advanced app settings → App execution aliases.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Anaconda users: run `conda deactivate` until the (base) prefix disappears. If it won't go away, open a new terminal in VS Code.\n"
"</Admonition> \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Mga gumagamit ng Anaconda: patakbuhin ang `conda deactivate` hanggang mawala ang (base) prefix. Kung hindi ito mawala, magbukas ng bagong terminal sa VS Code.\n"
"</Admonition> \n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Git (optional)\">\n"
"    Only needed if you clone lab repositories.  Run `winget install Git.Git`.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Git (opsyonal)\">\n"
"    Kailangan lamang kung magcco-clone ka ng mga lab repository.  Patakbuhin ang `winget install Git.Git`.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2 - Set up the Python virtual environment with Qiskit {#step-2-set-up-the-python-virtual-environment-with-qiskit}"
msgstr "Step 2 - I-set up ang Python virtual environment gamit ang Qiskit {#step-2-set-up-the-python-virtual-environment-with-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Reset the VS Code terminal\">\n"
"Open the VS Code terminal and reset it:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"I-reset ang VS Code terminal\">\n"
"Buksan ang VS Code terminal at i-reset ito:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Create and activate a virtual environment\">\n"
"Allow script execution (once per user), then create the virtual environment:\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Gumawa at i-activate ang isang virtual environment\">\n"
"Payagan ang script execution (isang beses bawat user), pagkatapos ay gumawa ng virtual environment:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If activation shows a red error about \"scripts disabled\", the `Set-ExecutionPolicy` line was not run.  Run it manually, then retry.\n"
msgstr "Kung nagpapakita ang activation ng pulang error tungkol sa \"scripts disabled\", hindi na-run ang linyang `Set-ExecutionPolicy`.  Patakbuhin ito nang manu-mano, pagkatapos ay subukan ulit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your prompt should now show `(workspace)`. \n"
msgstr "Dapat ay ipinapakita na ngayon ng iyong prompt ang `(workspace)`. \n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify:\n"
msgstr "Verify:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Install packages\">\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"I-install ang mga package\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`--prefer-binary` avoids compiling `qiskit-aer` from source. If `qiskit-aer` still fails, try `pip install qiskit-aer --only-binary=:all:` or skip it.  `qiskit-aer` is optional and is only needed for local simulation.\n"
msgstr "Iniiwasan ng `--prefer-binary` ang pag-compile ng `qiskit-aer` mula sa source. Kung nabigo pa rin ang `qiskit-aer`, subukan ang `pip install qiskit-aer --only-binary=:all:` o laktawan ito.  Opsyonal ang `qiskit-aer` at kailangan lamang para sa lokal na simulation.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Do NOT run `pip install --upgrade qiskit` after setup. Upgrading to a new minor version breaks C extensions built against the old one.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3 - Load the MSVC environment {#step-3-load-the-msvc-environment}"
msgstr "Hakbang 3 - I-load ang MSVC environment {#step-3-load-the-msvc-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the following code in each new Python session (for example, each time you restart a Jupyter kernel). It locates and loads the MSVC developer environment automatically so you don't need the x64 built-in command prompt.\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang sumusunod na code sa bawat bagong Python session (halimbawa, sa tuwing nire-restart mo ang isang Jupyter kernel). Awtomatiko nitong hinahanap at nilo-load ang MSVC developer environment kaya hindi mo na kailangan ang built-in na x64 command prompt.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The example in this documentation builds C extension modules by using `setuptools` with MSVC. Generally, you define `QISKIT_PYTHON_EXTENSION`, include `qiskit.h`, and call `qk_import()` in your init function. Only headers from `qiskit.capi.get_include()` are needed at build time — no library is linked. See [Extend Qiskit in Python with C](/guides/c-extension-for-python) for details.\n"
msgstr "Bumubuo ang halimbawa sa dokumentasyong ito ng mga C extension module gamit ang `setuptools` kasama ang MSVC. Sa pangkalahatan, dine-define mo ang `QISKIT_PYTHON_EXTENSION`, isinasama ang `qiskit.h`, at tinatawag ang `qk_import()` sa iyong init function. Mga header lang mula sa `qiskit.capi.get_include()` ang kailangan sa build time — walang naka-link na library. Tingnan ang [Extend Qiskit in Python with C](/guides/c-extension-for-python) para sa mga detalye.\n"

